Harness lets you pick which AI model does the thinking.

60
00:03:53,070 --> 00:03:59,844
我们有 DeepSeek v4.1 Flash 和 DeepSeek v4 Pro，你甚至还可以选择它思考的强度。
We've got DeepSeek v4.1 Flash and DeepSeek v4 Pro, and you can even choose how hard it thinks.

61
00:04:00,494 --> 00:04:03,160
对于我们的项目，我们将思考强度设置为高。
For our project, we're setting the thinking effort to high.

62
00:04:03,822 --> 00:04:08,060
但记住，我们的目标是完全不花钱去搞这些昂贵的 AI。
But remember, our whole goal is to do this without paying for expensive AI.

63
00:04:08,686 --> 00:04:13,400
所以接下来，我们要接入 OpenRouter，它能提供我们可以免费使用的模型。
So in the next level, we're plugging in OpenRouter, which gives us models we can use for free.

64
00:04:14,094 --> 00:04:17,300
先别急，因为现在还有一个更大的问题。
Hold that thought, because right now there's a bigger problem.

65
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:25,156
我们的开发者很聪明，但如果我们只是说「帮我克隆这个应用」，
它根本不知道原版是怎么运行的。
Our developer is smart, but if we just say, build me a copy of this app, it has no idea how the original actually works.

66
00:04:25,582 --> 00:04:26,400
那它就只能靠瞎猜了。
It would be guessing.

67
00:04:27,022 --> 00:04:32,080
而瞎猜会导致你得到的东西看起来没问题，但只要一按按钮就崩溃。
And guessing is how you end up with something that looks right, but falls apart the moment you click a button.

68
00:04:32,782 --> 00:04:34,400
这就是 REA 发挥作用的地方。
That's where REA comes in.

69
00:04:35,020 --> 00:04:37,700
REA 代表「逆向工程任何事物」。
REA stands for reverse engineer anything.

70
00:04:38,414 --> 00:04:40,980
把它想象成软件领域的侦探工具包。
Think of it as a detective's toolkit for software.

71
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:44,420
单独看它，只是架子上的一堆工具。
On its own, it's just a box of tools sitting on a shelf.

72
00:04:44,910 --> 00:04:48,260
但把它接入你的 AI，AI 就会变成那个侦探。
But plug it into your AI, and the AI becomes the detective.

73
00:04:48,974 --> 00:04:53,828
它可以打开一个应用，研究它的构建方式，并追踪每个功能到底是怎么运作的。
It can open up an app, study how it's built, and trace exactly how each feature works.

74
00:04:54,478 --> 00:04:57,840
桌面应用、Electron 应用，甚至是编译后的程序。
Desktop apps, Electron apps, even compiled programs.

75
00:04:58,340 --> 00:05:00,160
REA 为每种类型都有专门的工具。
REA has a tool for each of them.

76
00:05:00,782 --> 00:05:05,668
所以我们的开发者不再是瞎猜，而是先去调查，然后再去构建。
So instead of guessing, our developer actually investigates first, and then builds.

77
00:05:05,902 --> 00:05:07,860
而且 REA 并不局限于某一个 AI。
And REA isn't tied to one AI.

78
00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:13,460
它支持 Cloud Code、Gemini、CLI、Cursor 以及一大堆其他的。
It works with Cloud Code, Gemini, CLI, Cursor, and a bunch of others.

79
00:05:13,934 --> 00:05:16,360
